es/Test_subject_beneath_mechanical_arm_202607101926.mp4","file":"assets/05_damocles/Test_subject_beneath_mechanical_arm_202607101926.mp4","in":3.88,"text":"They wanted to map the human mind, to connect the brain directly to a digital world.","kw":["wanted","human","mind","connect","brain","directly","digital","world"],"ch":5},{"t":28.62,"dur":3.68,"clip":"05_damocles/Astronauts_undergoing_suspension…_202607101926.mp4","file":"assets/05_damocles/Astronauts_undergoing_suspension…_202607101926.mp4","in":4,"text":"Scientists created artificial worlds to test the human mind.","kw":["scientists","created","artificial","worlds","test","human","mind"],"ch":5},{"t":33.45,"dur":5,"clip":"05_damocles/Tracking_hardware_cables_ceiling…_202607101926.mp4","file":"assets/05_damocles/Tracking_hardware_cables_ceiling…_202607101926.mp4","in":0,"text":"In 1968, scientists created a device.","kw":["scientists","created","device"],"ch":5},{"t":42.7,"dur":4.32,"clip":"05_damocles/Technical_papers_and_diagrams_desk_202607101926.mp4","file":"assets/05_damocles/Technical_papers_and_diagrams_desk_202607101926.mp4","in":0,"text":"In 1966, military engineers created a new world.","kw":["military","engineers","created","world"],"ch":5},{"t":50.03,"dur":5,"clip":"05_damocles/Headset_in_university_lab_202607101926.mp4","file":"assets/05_damocles/Headset_in_university_lab_202607101926.mp4","in":4.88,"text":"We thought we were looking at a new world, but we were only looking at ourselves.","kw":["thought","looking","world","only","ourselves"],"ch":5},{"t":74.95,"dur":4.16,"clip":"05_damocles/AI-generated_historical_reconstr…_202607101854_2.mp4","file":"assets/05_damocles/AI-generated_historical_reconstr…_202607101854_2.mp4","in":5.56,"text":"only the cold machinery remained, a quiet aftermath of a forgotten future.","kw":["only","cold","machinery","remained","quiet","aftermath","forgotten","future"],"ch":5},{"t":81.75,"dur":4,"clip":"05_damocles/Headset_in_university_lab_202607101926.mp4","file":"assets/05_damocles/Headset_in_university_lab_202607101926.mp4","in":0,"text":"In 1968, we built a cage to trap the future.","kw":["built","cage","trap","future"],"ch":5},{"t":90.41,"dur":4,"clip":"05_damocles/Test_subject_beneath_mechanical_arm_202607101926.mp4","file":"assets/05_damocles/Test_subject_beneath_mechanical_arm_202607101926.mp4","in":0,"text":"In 1968, scientists began a strange experiment.","kw":["scientists","began","strange","experiment"],"ch":5},{"t":97.18,"dur":4.12,"clip":"05_damocles/Astronauts_undergoing_suspension…_202607101926.mp4","file":"assets/05_damocles/Astronauts_undergoing_suspension…_202607101926.mp4","in":0,"text":"In the 1960s, a new idea of isolation began to emerge.","kw":["idea","isolation","began","emerge"],"ch":5},{"t":102.33,"dur":5.68,"clip":"05_damocles/Technicians_watching_subject_und…_202607101926.mp4","file":"assets/05_damocles/Technicians_watching_subject_und…_202607101926.mp4","in":0,"text":"But this was not just a tool for a new kind of vision.","kw":["just","tool","kind","vision"],"ch":5},{"t":109.33,"dur":5,"clip":"05_damocles/Industrial_lifting_machinery_dar…_202607101926.mp4","file":"assets/05_damocles/Industrial_lifting_machinery_dar…_202607101926.mp4","in":0,"text":"But this was an illusion.","kw":["illusion"],"ch":5},{"t":117.4,"dur":3,"clip":"05_damocles/Mechanical_arm_descending_toward…_202607101926.mp4","file":"assets/05_damocles/Mechanical_arm_descending_toward…_202607101926.mp4","in":6.88,"text":"by holding a sword directly over our heads.","kw":["holding","sword","directly","over","heads"],"ch":5},{"t":123.22,"dur":1.04,"clip":"05_damocles/AI-generated_historical_reconstr…_202607101854_4.mp4","file":"assets/05_damocles/AI-generated_historical_reconstr…_202607101854_4.mp4","in":7.94,"text":"Keep your movement slow.","kw":["keep","your","movement","slow"],"ch":5}],"duck":[[0,10.01,0.55],[10.26,18.57,0.28],[21.51,27.76,0.28],[28.62,32.55,0.28],[33.45,38.7,0.28],[42.7,47.27,0.28],[50.03,55.28,0.28],[74.95,79.36,0